{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Leisure Time", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": " Go Fly a Kite", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Adverbs of Frequency", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of frequency (always, usually, never, etc.) say how often something happens.<br />  Sometimes the adverb specifies the exact frequency of the action, like <span class=\"italic\">yearly</span> or <span class=\"italic\">daily</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " They are usually placed before the verb. With verb tenses that have two parts, like the Present Continuous tense, you put the adverbs of frequency between the auxiliary verb and the main verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" How often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 100%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 60%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rarely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 10%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0%\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "People often tend to visit some of the new kite stores that are regularly opening in big cities around the world.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Kite lovers always make a point of using kites for many reasons.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of manner are used to talk about how something is done.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " When a verb has no object (intransitive verb), the adverb of manner often comes immediately after it.     ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <ul><li><span class=\"italic t\">Kite lovers participate enthusiastically.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Adverbs of manner can also be used after infinitives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">It's important to drive carefully.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take into account that we can form adverbs from adjectives by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ly</span>, and when the adjective ends in <span class=\"strong\">y</span>, change it to <span class=\"italic\">\u2013ily</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "ready \u2013 readily", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">They can also subscribe to some of the many kite magazines that are readily available for kite lovers.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The adjectives <span class=\"italic\">fast</span>, <span class=\"italic\">hard</span>, <span class=\"italic\">well</span> and <span class=\"italic\">straight</span> do not change when they become adverbs.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "go fly a kite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "go away; get out of here", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Have you ever heard the expression \u201cgo fly a kite?\u201d ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when talking about flying a kite.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gradually", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a gradual, regular manner", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Kite-flying has gradually become a very popular leisure activity. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to subscribe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to receive a publication on a regular basis", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People can subscribe to some of the many kite magazines.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "readily", "type": "name"}, {"content": "easily and quickly; without difficulty", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Kite magazines are readily available for kite lovers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "kite-flying", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the activity of flying a kite", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Kite-flying festivals are being attended yearly by hundreds of people from around the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le17ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a different leisure activity from this lesson (not kite-flying).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find a short video in English on the Internet about this activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes about the activity. Try to find ways in which enthusiasts of that activity can participate.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down other information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present the information to the class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I listen to a video on a leisure activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes about the activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present the information.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le17ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "Have you ever heard the expression \u201cgo fly a kite?\u201d Although it used to mean \u201cgo away\u201d, kite-flying has gradually become a very popular leisure activity. On a sunny day at the beach, you will usually see people flying kites.", "id": 1, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "People often tend to visit some of the new kite stores that are regularly opening in big cities around the world. They can also subscribe to some of the many kite magazines that are readily available for kite lovers. Whenever they get a chance, kite lovers also participate in lively discussion groups on the Internet. Besides that, kite-flying festivals are being attended yearly by hundreds of people from around the world.", "id": 2, "time": "13000"}, {"image": "engenn6le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "Kite lovers always make a point of using kites for many reasons, including sports, art or religious ceremonies. The fun, safe, and creative sport of kite-flying seems to be one of the most positive sports today. So, next time anyone tells you to go fly a kite, maybe you should!", "id": 3, "time": "34500"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about free time activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about people's habits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about how something happens or how someone behaves. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you seen a kite-flying festival?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Would you like to see it?  Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Are you an enthusiast of kite-flying?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nSally continues her article on kite-flying. What do you think about this <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">leisure</span> activity?\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructio